  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Assistance Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Asistencia Familiar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE SUPPORT TO PRAF FOR UP TO US$20 MILLIONS, WILL PERMIT THE TRANSFERENCE OF INCOME TO THE POOREST POPULATION OF EXTREMELY POOR MUNICIPIOS, INCREASE THEIR BUYING CAPACITY AND IMPROVE THEIR EDUCATIONAL, HEALTH AND NUTRITION LEVEL. THE LOAN HAS THREE COMPONENTS: (I) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING AND PROGRAM MANAGEMENT; (II) DISTRIBUTION OF BONUSES: SCHOLAR AND MATERNAL INFANTILE; AND (III) PROMOTION OF PRAFS SUSTAINABILITY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
